/** 
 * @page VWCorePage VWCore
 *
 * The Core Vision Library forms the heart of VW, providing image
 * classes, image IO, feature extraction and geometric
 * calculations. Also, the core library contains abstract base classes for the sequencers 
 * and displays which are implemented in the more specific libraries. As it is the largest
 * part of the library collection, the main user oriented bits are collected into modules 
 * as follows:
 *
 *     - \link Image Image \endlink :
 *             Image classes, file IO, conversion from raw data and
 *             colour model conversions.
 *
 *     - \link ImageProcessing ImageProcessing \endlink :
 *             Operations on images (eg convolution, feature detection etc).
 *  
 *     - \link GeometricObjects GeometricObjects \endlink : 
 *             Objects to represent geometric constructs such
 *             as points, lines, rotations, multi-view relations etc.
 *
 *     - \link GeometricAlgorithms GeometricAlgorithms \endlink : 
 *             Algorithms and operations on geometric objects, such as
 *             calculating image-relations.
 *
 *     - \link CoreSequencers CoreSequencers \endlink : 
 *             The base class and basic file-based sequencers. Sequencers
 *             provide stepped or continuous retrieval of sequential
 *             images.
 *
 *     - \link CoreGraphics CoreGraphics \endlink : 
 *             The base classes for displays and basic (non-optimised)
 *             drawing functions. Also, functions for drawing things
 *             on images (including other images - ie. image compositing).
 *
 *     - \link MathsStuff MathsStuff \endlink : 
 *             Some mathematical utility functions and classes, such as
 *             random number generation, probability densities, 
 *             Kalman filtering.
 */
